---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Academics & Prep">
  <section class="page-hero"><img src="/images/player-portrait.jpg" alt="Academy player holding a football" width="2841" height="3552" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="page-overlay"></div><div class="container page-title"><p class="eyebrow">Scholars are ballers</p><h1>Keep your<br/>future in play.</h1><p>Football can open doors. Education and preparation help young people make the most of them.</p><a class="btn" href="/apply">Talk with the academy ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container acad-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Academics & preparation</p><h2>Ambition needs<br/>a strong base.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">We believe a young player’s development should leave room for learning, personal interests, and plans that reach beyond the game.</p><p>Our academy conversations include a player’s academic stage and goals. We encourage families to share what support they are looking for so we can explain the current pathway honestly and clearly.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">What we value</p><h2>Carry it with you.</h2><div class="value-grid"><article><h3>Curiosity</h3><p>Stay open to new ideas, feedback, and learning opportunities.</p></article><article><h3>Consistency</h3><p>Build steady habits that support progress on and off the pitch.</p></article><article><h3>Character</h3><p>Show respect, resilience, and responsibility in the way you play and live.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container ask"><p class="eyebrow">Parents & guardians</p><h2>Let’s talk about<br/>the right fit.</h2><p>Share a player’s current academic level and the pathway you’re exploring. The academy can follow up with current details.</p><a class="btn" href="/apply">Make an enquiry ↗</a></div></section>
  <style>.page-hero{min-height:600px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--navy);color:white}.page-hero>img,.page-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.page-hero>img{object-position:50% 35%}.page-overlay{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#091a37ed,#091a3780 55%,#091a3710)}.page-title{position:relative;padding:5rem 0}.page-title .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.page-title h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,7rem)}.page-title>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:34rem;color:#e2e9f2}.acad-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)}.value-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.value-grid article{border-top:1px solid #ffffff55;padding-top:1rem}.value-grid h3{color:var(--gold)}.value-grid p{color:#c1cddd}.ask{max-width:720px;text-align:center}.ask p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:500px;margin-inline:auto}.ask .btn{margin-top:1rem}@media(max-width:700px){.acad-grid,.value-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
